#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md:467
msgid "Stored-pool studies support separating synthesis from release and a strong temperature response of release. The exact GPP saturation, Q10 synthesis, capacity limiter, and degradation coefficients are calibratable ParameterManager-backed phenomenological choices, not a universal source law."
msgstr "储存池研究支持将合成与释放分开，并表明释放具有强温度响应。精确的 GPP 饱和关系、合成 Q10、容量限制器和降解系数均为 ParameterManager 支持的可校准现象学选择，而非普适的源项定律。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md
msgid "air temperature, gross photosynthesis, and pool concentration are empirical drivers; no thermodynamic effort is claimed"
msgstr "气温、gross photosynthesis 与 pool concentration 是经验 driver；不作 thermodynamic effort 声明"

# | msgid "" "the bounded pool ledger is evaluated once, and its rate and port
