# | with an " "explicit identity N_h"
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "the bounded pool ledger is evaluated once, and its rate and port cochains are evaluated as $\\dot{x} = N_{h} r_{h}$ by advance_reaction_network with an explicit identity $N_{h}$"
msgstr "有界储存池账本只求值一次；其速率与端口上链通过 advance_reaction_network 按 $\\dot{x} = N_{h} r_{h}$ 求值，并采用显式恒等 $N_{h}$"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md
msgid "MonoterpeneSynthesis.forward evaluates one bounded storage ledger, exposes its residual, and wraps the resulting rate and port cochains through the existing reaction-network runtime."
msgstr "MonoterpeneSynthesis.forward 求值一个有界 storage ledger，公开其 residual，并通过现有 reaction-network runtime 包装所得 rate 与 port cochains。"

# | msgid "" "the identity N_h wrapper covers emission, synthesis, positive
# | plant-" "carbon allocation, degradation, pool-tendency, storage-carbon,
# and
# | " "boundary-residual cochains; this is level-2 wrapping rather than strict
# "
# | "stoichiometric closure."
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "the identity $N_{h}$ wrapper covers emission, synthesis, positive plant-carbon allocation, degradation, pool-tendency, storage-carbon, and boundary-residual cochains; this is level-2 wrapping rather than strict stoichiometric closure."
msgstr "恒等 $N_{h}$ 包装覆盖排放、合成、正植物碳分配、降解、池趋势、储存碳和边界残差上链；这是 level-2 包装，并非严格化学计量闭合。"

