#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md:710
msgid "The light factor is Guenther et al. (2012) Eq. (3) with the Table 4 sesquiterpene light-dependent fraction and the Eq. (4) light-dependent activity; the temperature factor is the Eq. (7) blend of the Eq. (11) exponential about the MEGAN standard temperature T_s and the Eq. (8) light-dependent response, with the Table 4 Other Sesquiterpenes row; stress is the most limiting supplied factor. The RELIC reduced closure converts a dry-leaf-mass-normalized factor through LAI k_f; it is not the canonical MEGAN2.1 vegetation-type, ground-area emission-factor formulation. Stored-emitter literature requires synthesis and release to remain distinct when storage is represented; this no-storage closure reports emitted compound carbon only as an explicit allocation proxy."
msgstr "光照因子采用 Guenther 等（2012）式（3），使用表 4 的倍半萜光依赖比例和式（4）的光依赖活性；温度因子采用式（7），将围绕 MEGAN 标准温度 T_s 的式（11）指数响应与式（8）光依赖响应混合，参数来自表 4 的 Other Sesquiterpenes 行；胁迫取已提供因子中限制最强者。RELIC 的简化闭合关系通过 LAI k_f 转换按叶片干质量归一化的因子，并非 MEGAN2.1 按植被类型和地表面积定义排放因子的标准表达式。对于显式表示储存的情形，储存型排放植物的文献要求区分合成和释放；这个不表示储存的闭合关系仅将已排放化合物的碳作为显式分配代理量报告。"

# | msgid "" "SesquiterpeneSynthesis.forward validates the declared state
# ports,
# | " "evaluates one MEGAN-style empirical rate, converts the
# ParameterManager-"
# | "backed mass rate through the existing UnitConverter, derives the
# positive"
# | " no-storage plant-carbon allocation proxy, calls
# advance_reaction_network"
# | " with explicit stoichiometric_N and rates, and emits the canonical molar
# "
# | "and carbon ports plus namespaced diagnostics."
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "SesquiterpeneSynthesis.forward validates the declared state ports, evaluates one MEGAN-family empirical response rate, maps the mass-normalized rate through required LAI and ParameterManager-backed $k_{f}$, converts it through the existing UnitConverter, derives the positive no-storage plant-carbon allocation proxy, calls advance_reaction_network with explicit stoichiometric_N and rates, and emits the canonical molar and carbon ports plus namespaced diagnostics."
msgstr "SesquiterpeneSynthesis.forward 验证声明的状态端口，求值一个 MEGAN 系列经验响应速率，通过必需的 LAI 和 ParameterManager 支持的 $k_{f}$ 映射质量归一化速率，经现有 UnitConverter 转换，推导正的无储存植物碳分配代理量，以显式 stoichiometric_N 和 rates 调用 advance_reaction_network，并输出规范摩尔端口、碳端口及命名空间诊断量。"

# | msgid "" "SesquiterpeneSynthesis.forward materializes stoichiometric_N and
# | rates, " "then lowers x_dot = N_h r_h through advance_reaction_network
# with
# | " "open_system_route=port."
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/biosphere.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "SesquiterpeneSynthesis.forward materializes stoichiometric_N and rates, then lowers $\\dot{x} = N_{h} r_{h}$ through advance_reaction_network with `open_system_route=port`."
msgstr "SesquiterpeneSynthesis.forward 实体化 stoichiometric_N 和 rates，随后通过 advance_reaction_network 以 `open_system_route=port` 将 $\\dot{x} = N_{h} r_{h}$ 下沉到运行时。"

